{
    "background_story": "Marcos was a talented young musician from a small town in Brazil. Growing up, he would often gaze up at the night sky, feeling an inexplicable connection to the stars twinkling above. This sense of wonder inspired him to create music that was out of this world. Marcos' soulful voice and masterful guitar playing quickly gained him a local following, but it was his big break on a popular talent show that catapulted him to stardom. Dubbed the 'Star of Samba,' Marcos' charismatic stage presence and heartfelt performances won over audiences worldwide. He went on to release critically acclaimed albums, collaborating with top artists and performing to sold-out crowds. Marcos' music remained true to his roots, shining bright like a star that guides and inspires others to chase their dreams.",
